flowchart TB
    subgraph LOGS["Working logs (private is fine)"]
        SL[SESSION_LOG.md<br/>what happened, when] ~~~ DE[DECISIONS.md<br/>what was agreed, and why]
        OQ[OPEN_QUESTIONS.md<br/>what blocks work] ~~~ JO[JOURNAL.md<br/>mistakes, corrections, lessons]
    end
    subgraph REPO["In the product repo (public if the repo is)"]
        ST[STATUS.md<br/>what is built, checked and open] ~~~ SPC[The specs' change tables<br/>what changed during each build]
    end
    LOGS --> HO[HANDOVER files<br/>the bridge to the next session]
    REPO --> HO
